{"code":20000,"message":"OK","data":{"items":[{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","forex-channel","goldc-channel","oil-channel","us-stock-channel","hk-stock-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e美国总统特朗普谈巴西：选举结果看起来很糟糕。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"美国总统特朗普谈巴西：选举结果看起来很糟糕。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793043362,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186448,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186448"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","financing-channel","forex-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e周一（10月26日）纽约尾盘，美元兑日元涨0.37%，报157.45日元，日内交投区间为156.65-157.64日元，北京时间10:41-23:31持续上扬。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e欧元兑日元涨0.18%，报176.05日元；英镑兑日元涨0.18%，报210.165日元；日元兑离岸人民币跌0.40%，报4.2345元。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"周一（10月26日）纽约尾盘，美元兑日元涨0.37%，报157.45日元，日内交投区间为156.65-157.64日元，北京时间10:41-23:31持续上扬。\n\n欧元兑日元涨0.18%，报176.05日元；英镑兑日元涨0.18%，报210.165日元；日元兑离岸人民币跌0.40%，报4.2345元。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793043105,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186447,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186447"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["us-stock-channel","global-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003eSteel Dynamics股价迅速回吐涨幅，并转而下跌1.2%。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e纽柯钢铁跌幅迅速扩大至1.2%。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e据媒体报道，美国和加拿大正致力于达成一项协议，以放宽美国对加拿大钢铁和汽车进口的关税。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"Steel Dynamics股价迅速回吐涨幅，并转而下跌1.2%。\n\n纽柯钢铁跌幅迅速扩大至1.2%。\n\n据媒体报道，美国和加拿大正致力于达成一项协议，以放宽美国对加拿大钢铁和汽车进口的关税。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793042886,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186446,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186446"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","financing-channel","a-stock-channel","xgb-channel","us-stock-channel","commodity-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e周一（10月26日）纽约尾盘，彭博谷物分类指数跌0.90%，报30.5453点，较亚太早盘开盘水平大致持平，北京时间22:38曾跌至30.2846点。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eCBOT玉米期货跌0.22%，CBOT小麦期货跌1.52%。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eCBOT大豆期货跌1.16%，报12.5350美元/蒲式耳，豆粕期货跌1.88%，豆油期货涨0.28%。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eCBOT瘦肉猪期货跌1.30%，活牛期货大致持平，饲牛期货高开低走最终涨0.16%。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"周一（10月26日）纽约尾盘，彭博谷物分类指数跌0.90%，报30.5453点，较亚太早盘开盘水平大致持平，北京时间22:38曾跌至30.2846点。\n\nCBOT玉米期货跌0.22%，CBOT小麦期货跌1.52%。\n\nCBOT大豆期货跌1.16%，报12.5350美元/蒲式耳，豆粕期货跌1.88%，豆油期货涨0.28%。\n\nCBOT瘦肉猪期货跌1.30%，活牛期货大致持平，饲牛期货高开低走最终涨0.16%。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793042804,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186445,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"芝加哥小麦期货跌超1.5%，大豆跌超1.1%，豆粕跌约1.9%","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186445"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","us-stock-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e据知情人士透露，Doordash收购Instacart的磋商处于高级阶段。（华尔街日报）\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"据知情人士透露，Doordash收购Instacart的磋商处于高级阶段。（华尔街日报）","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793042746,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186444,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186444"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","financing-channel","forex-channel","goldc-channel","oil-channel","us-stock-channel","hk-stock-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e周一（10月26日）纽约尾盘，ICE美元指数涨0.17%，报101.984点，日内交投区间为101.582-102.056点，北京时间10:44-21:59持续上扬。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e彭博美元指数涨0.10%，报1222.25点，日内交投区间为1219.65-1223.58点。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"周一（10月26日）纽约尾盘，ICE美元指数涨0.17%，报101.984点，日内交投区间为101.582-102.056点，北京时间10:44-21:59持续上扬。\n\n彭博美元指数涨0.10%，报1222.25点，日内交投区间为1219.65-1223.58点。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793042561,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186443,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186443"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","us-stock-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e一家联邦上诉法院表示，美联储必须重写其关于封顶借记卡交易处理费的规则，因为现有规则违反了国会的立法意图。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e美联储的规则允许银行在计算借记卡刷卡费时计入某些费用（例如欺诈预防支出），法院表示这不符合2010年《多德-弗兰克法案》（Dodd-Frank Act）的要求。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e该裁决维持了下级法院取消美联储借记卡交换费上限的判决。商家认为，美联储应用符合法律且能减轻商品价格上涨压力的规则来取代现有规则。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"一家联邦上诉法院表示，美联储必须重写其关于封顶借记卡交易处理费的规则，因为现有规则违反了国会的立法意图。\n\n美联储的规则允许银行在计算借记卡刷卡费时计入某些费用（例如欺诈预防支出），法院表示这不符合2010年《多德-弗兰克法案》（Dodd-Frank Act）的要求。\n\n该裁决维持了下级法院取消美联储借记卡交换费上限的判决。商家认为，美联储应用符合法律且能减轻商品价格上涨压力的规则来取代现有规则。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793042144,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186442,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"美国联邦上诉法院推翻美联储 2011 年借记卡刷卡费规则","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186442"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","us-stock-channel","financing-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e城堡证券认为，市场对人工智能交易的投入如此之大，到了一旦巨额投入产生不了回报就几乎没有犯错空间的地步。该公司欧洲、中东和非洲固定收益销售主管Nohshad Shah在一份研报中写道，科技股的抛售表明，投资者在巨额人工智能支出最终能否创造足够利润的问题上正变得愈发苛刻。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"\u003cp\u003e“现在经济和股市有这么大一部分都押注在人工智能交易上，而其它风险也可能显现出来，所以市场几乎没有任何犯错的余地，” Shah写道。围绕人工智能交易的利弊之争在知名投资者中愈演愈烈，城堡掌门人肯·格里芬不久前直言，投资者“几乎可以肯定”正处于人工智能泡沫之中。但黑石集团总裁Jon Gray则说需求呈“抛物线式”增长。城堡投资联席首席投资官Pablo Salame警告说，人工智能热所到之处会留下一些“牺牲者”。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_text":"城堡证券认为，市场对人工智能交易的投入如此之大，到了一旦巨额投入产生不了回报就几乎没有犯错空间的地步。该公司欧洲、中东和非洲固定收益销售主管Nohshad Shah在一份研报中写道，科技股的抛售表明，投资者在巨额人工智能支出最终能否创造足够利润的问题上正变得愈发苛刻。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793041884,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186441,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"AI交易规模惊人，城堡证券称到了“没有容错空间”的地步","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186441"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","us-stock-channel","oil-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e有史以来包裹运费最昂贵的一年，正朝着以有史以来最高的假日季（感恩节+圣诞节）配送价格收官。飙升的柴油价格推动UPS和联邦快递进一步提高燃油附加费率，从而推高了零售商的成本。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e根据TD Cowen/AFS货运指数，第四季度的节日相关包裹量可能翻倍，届时包括电商订单在内的陆运价格预计将比去年同期上涨5.8%。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"\u003cp\u003e该指数分析了包括主要零售商在内的1,800家托运人的匿名数据，预测更快捷的快递包裹运费将较2025年第四季度上涨13.8%。由于包裹成本会根据重量、尺寸和目的地而有所不同，该指数报告的是百分比变化而非具体金额。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e“燃油成本是大家最关心的焦点，而这方面依然没有真正的好消息，”AFS物流公司首席分析官明舒·贝茨表示。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e据美国能源信息署数据显示，截至10月19日，美国公路柴油平均价格为每加仑6.28美元，较2月28日美国和以色列袭击伊朗以来上涨了65%。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e但贝茨指出，柴油价格上涨仅占燃油附加费成本的不到30%。她表示，由于UPS和联邦快递等行业领军企业调整了附加费计算方式，由此产生的附加费涨幅远超燃油价格涨幅——甚至在燃油价格持平的情况下，附加费仍会上涨。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_text":"有史以来包裹运费最昂贵的一年，正朝着以有史以来最高的假日季（感恩节+圣诞节）配送价格收官。飙升的柴油价格推动UPS和联邦快递进一步提高燃油附加费率，从而推高了零售商的成本。\n\n根据TD Cowen/AFS货运指数，第四季度的节日相关包裹量可能翻倍，届时包括电商订单在内的陆运价格预计将比去年同期上涨5.8%。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793041694,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186439,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"受柴油价格上涨导致的附加费影响，美国零售商面临创纪录的假日配送费用","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186439"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","us-stock-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e高盛集团的Tony Pasquariello表示，华尔街遭遇7月份以来最大规模抛售之际，对冲基金上周四以两年来最快速度卖出科技股，令市场对这一交易的信念受到严重质疑。高盛对冲基金客户业务负责人Pasquariello在给客户的报告中写道，虽然标普500指数三个月来一直区间震荡，但随着AI交易回吐，表面的平静掩盖了自6月底以来“持续的表现回撤”。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"\u003cp\u003e他表示，数周以来，对冲基金一直在削减股票净敞口和总敞口。“我们是否已经看到投降式抛售？虽然无法准确判断，但根据我从业务网络获得的各方面情况以及与客户的交流，感觉市场确实已经有些伤筋动骨，”Pasquariello在谈到上周四的交易时写道。纳斯达克100指数当日重挫2.9%。科技股周一反弹，该指数上涨1%。Pasquariello在日期为10月23日的报告中表示，引发抛售的压力部分来自仓位和基本面。他表示，经历上半年的强劲表现后，投资者已重仓做多人工智能主题，但此后市场“合力重创了共识持仓”。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_text":"高盛集团的Tony Pasquariello表示，华尔街遭遇7月份以来最大规模抛售之际，对冲基金上周四以两年来最快速度卖出科技股，令市场对这一交易的信念受到严重质疑。高盛对冲基金客户业务负责人Pasquariello在给客户的报告中写道，虽然标普500指数三个月来一直区间震荡，但随着AI交易回吐，表面的平静掩盖了自6月底以来“持续的表现回撤”。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793041602,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186438,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"高盛：对冲基金以两年来最快速度抛售科技股，AI交易信念面临考验","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186438"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","a-stock-channel","xgb-channel","financing-channel","us-stock-channel","hk-stock-channel","bond-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e美国高评级债券销售料将达到1.76万亿美元，创历史新高。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"美国高评级债券销售料将达到1.76万亿美元，创历史新高。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793041573,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186437,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186437"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","forex-channel","goldc-channel","oil-channel","us-stock-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e惠誉评级美国经济研究主管：在近期整体通胀加速之前，美国通胀的广度就已经开始扩大。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e这表明通胀的上升并不完全是能源因素所致。即使能源压力消退，更广泛的物价上涨也可能会减缓通胀回归目标的步伐，并导致货币政策在更长时间内维持偏紧水平。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"惠誉评级美国经济研究主管：在近期整体通胀加速之前，美国通胀的广度就已经开始扩大。\n\n这表明通胀的上升并不完全是能源因素所致。即使能源压力消退，更广泛的物价上涨也可能会减缓通胀回归目标的步伐，并导致货币政策在更长时间内维持偏紧水平。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793041368,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186435,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186435"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","hk-stock-channel","a-stock-channel","xgb-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e恒生指数主连夜盘收跌0.01%，报23233点。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e恒生科技指数主连夜盘收涨0.08%，报3865点。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"恒生指数主连夜盘收跌0.01%，报23233点。\n\n恒生科技指数主连夜盘收涨0.08%，报3865点。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793041265,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186433,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186433"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/ivanka_avatar_1.png","display_name":"bumblebee","id":120000003947,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/120000003947"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","forex-channel","financing-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e在岸人民币兑美元（CNY）北京时间03:00收报6.6695元，较上周五夜盘收盘涨9点。成交量385.81亿美元。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"在岸人民币兑美元（CNY）北京时间03:00收报6.6695元，较上周五夜盘收盘涨9点。成交量385.81亿美元。","cover_images":[{"uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/ab4573ca-77b1-41c5-aab6-7c6fab258beb.png","height":539,"width":1230,"size":111777}],"display_time":1793041261,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186432,"images":[{"uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/ab4573ca-77b1-41c5-aab6-7c6fab258beb.png","height":539,"width":1230,"size":111777}],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186432"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","forex-channel","goldc-channel","oil-channel","us-stock-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e惠誉评级认为，在过去一年中，美国的通胀扩散趋势比其他发达经济体更为明显，这推高了物价压力证明比当前核心通胀数据所示更为持久的风险。根据惠誉评级发布的最新报告，这可能会导致美国利率在更长时间内保持高位。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e9月份，美国CPI组成部分中同比通胀率超过3%的比例达到了46%，是2018-19 年平均水平（23%）的两倍。这些增幅的广度表明，美国的物价压力已延伸至能源之外，并扩展到更广泛的商品和服务领域。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"\u003cp\u003e在欧元区和日本，通胀广度也依然高于疫情前的常态水平，不过近期变化不如美国显著。英国和加拿大的通胀广度则有所下降。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e美联储在9月将其目标利率区间上调至3.75%-4.00%，这是自2023年7月以来的首次加息。广泛分项中物价的持续上涨可能会推迟通胀回归目标的进程，并增加进一步紧缩的风险。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_text":"惠誉评级认为，在过去一年中，美国的通胀扩散趋势比其他发达经济体更为明显，这推高了物价压力证明比当前核心通胀数据所示更为持久的风险。根据惠誉评级发布的最新报告，这可能会导致美国利率在更长时间内保持高位。\n\n9月份，美国CPI组成部分中同比通胀率超过3%的比例达到了46%，是2018-19 年平均水平（23%）的两倍。这些增幅的广度表明，美国的物价压力已延伸至能源之外，并扩展到更广泛的商品和服务领域。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793039675,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186430,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"惠誉：美国更广泛的物价压力推高通胀持续性风险","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186430"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","goldc-channel","oil-channel","financing-channel","forex-channel","us-stock-channel","hk-stock-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003eWTI 12月原油期货收跌1.51美元，跌幅超过1.46%，报101.76美元/桶。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e布伦特12月原油期货收跌0.91美元，跌幅0.78%，报115.81美元/桶。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eNYMEX 11月天然气期货收报2.6020美元/百万英热单位。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eNYMEX 11月汽油期货收报3.2185美元/加仑，NYMEX 11月取暖油期货收报4.9120美元/加仑。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"WTI 12月原油期货收跌1.51美元，跌幅超过1.46%，报101.76美元/桶。\n\n布伦特12月原油期货收跌0.91美元，跌幅0.78%，报115.81美元/桶。\n\nNYMEX 11月天然气期货收报2.6020美元/百万英热单位。\n\nNYMEX 11月汽油期货收报3.2185美元/加仑，NYMEX 11月取暖油期货收报4.9120美元/加仑。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793039463,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186429,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186429"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","goldc-channel","oil-channel","a-stock-channel","xgb-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e上期所原油期货2612合约夜盘收跌0.87%，报733.30元人民币/桶。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e沪金夜盘收涨0.4%，沪银收涨0.31%。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"上期所原油期货2612合约夜盘收跌0.87%，报733.30元人民币/桶。\n\n沪金夜盘收涨0.4%，沪银收涨0.31%。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793039419,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186428,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186428"},{"article":{"id":3784502,"image":{"uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/e5094643-c388-4027-8c47-62ab647dc445.jpeg","height":628,"width":1024,"size":52840},"platforms":["wscn-platform","tech-platform"],"title":"OpenAI推出电脑操作强者GPT-6.1 Terra，Token效率为Claude Opus 5.5三倍、价格仅四分之一","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784502"},"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","us-stock-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003eOpenAI推出GPT-6.1 Terra，重点提升电脑操作、视觉理解和编程能力，可帮助用户撰写提案、看懂技术图纸、填写表格及编辑视频。与上一代相比，该模型完成电脑操作任务的速度提升逾3倍，API价格降低50%。API收费为每百万输入词元1美元、缓存输入词元0.05美元、输出词元5美元。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e性能方面，内部测试显示，低推理档位的错误率从53.6%降至16.7%；最高推理档位的错误率降至4.3%，较上一代下降18个百分点。编程测试中，最高推理档位得分从上一代公布的21.5%升至50.3%。新模型已向ChatGPTWork和Codex的Plus、Pro、Enterprise及Edu用户开放，并通过API提供。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"OpenAI推出GPT-6.1 Terra，重点提升电脑操作、视觉理解和编程能力，可帮助用户撰写提案、看懂技术图纸、填写表格及编辑视频。与上一代相比，该模型完成电脑操作任务的速度提升逾3倍，API价格降低50%。API收费为每百万输入词元1美元、缓存输入词元0.05美元、输出词元5美元。\n\n性能方面，内部测试显示，低推理档位的错误率从53.6%降至16.7%；最高推理档位的错误率降至4.3%，较上一代下降18个百分点。编程测试中，最高推理档位得分从上一代公布的21.5%升至50.3%。新模型已向ChatGPTWork和Codex的Plus、Pro、Enterprise及Edu用户开放，并通过API提供。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793038079,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186427,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":2,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"OpenAI推出GPT-6.1 Terra，电脑操作速度提升逾3倍 API价格降低50%","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186427"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","forex-channel","goldc-channel","oil-channel","us-stock-channel","hk-stock-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e当地时间26日，伊朗最高国家安全委员会秘书雷扎伊在伊朗、巴基斯坦、土耳其和沙特就地区安全与稳定举行的四方会谈结束后表示，地区合作本应早就启动，土耳其、巴基斯坦和沙特阿拉伯高级官员的访问表明，美国的威胁对世界各国的影响并不大。各方一致认为，西亚安全必须依靠自身力量，避免任何外国干预。雷扎伊还强调，以色列必须从黎巴嫩南部、叙利亚南部、加沙地带和约旦河西岸撤军，停止其侵略行径。（央视新闻）\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"当地时间26日，伊朗最高国家安全委员会秘书雷扎伊在伊朗、巴基斯坦、土耳其和沙特就地区安全与稳定举行的四方会谈结束后表示，地区合作本应早就启动，土耳其、巴基斯坦和沙特阿拉伯高级官员的访问表明，美国的威胁对世界各国的影响并不大。各方一致认为，西亚安全必须依靠自身力量，避免任何外国干预。雷扎伊还强调，以色列必须从黎巴嫩南部、叙利亚南部、加沙地带和约旦河西岸撤军，停止其侵略行径。（央视新闻）","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793038047,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3186426,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"伊朗最高国家安全委员会秘书雷扎伊：西亚安全必须依靠自身力量","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3186426"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa","display_name":"罗俊","id":694840,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/694840"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","us-stock-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003eAnthropic拓展面向非营利机构的Claude服务，推出Claude非营利组织专用插件。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"Anthropic拓展面向非营利机构的Claude服务，推出Claude非营利组织专用插件。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1793037631,"fund_codes":[],"glo